<title>SPAIN: Spain 1-yr bill yield up, 5-, 15-yr yields down.</title>
<headline>Spain 1-yr bill yield up, 5-, 15-yr yields down.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE   Yield   Pvs    Price   Pvs    Bid    Allocated </p>
<p>1-year  5.172  5.052   95.03  95.14 211.632   147.777</p>
<p>5-year  6.070  6.132  107.50 106.65 333.798   204.144</p>
<p>15-year 7.144  7.184  113.80 112.70  46.301    18.265</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2161</p>
</text>
